 "Watch through the gap", "zh": "从门缝里偷看", "goto": "e4_peek", "effects": {"family": 2}, "premium": false}]}}, "e4_in": {"ep": 4, "title_en": "Caught", "title_zh": "撞个正着", "next": "e4_found", "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/f5886a5b66c843ef936c398a23144876/e4_in.mp4"}, "idle": null, "captions": [{"s": 8.95, "e": 11.74, "who": "EDMUND", "en": "Miss Hart. Late hours, for a cat-sitter.", "zh": "哈特小姐。看猫的，睡得可真晚。"}, {"s": 12.47, "e": 14.9, "who": "IVY", "en": "And you're in Madam's study at midnight. Looking for something?", "zh": "而你半夜在夫人的书房里。在找东西？"}, {"s": 15.95, "e": 19.94, "who": "EDMUND", "en": "This was my aunt's study. Nothing in this house is your concern.", "zh": "这是我姑妈的书房。这房子里的事，轮不到你过问。"}], "look": "NIGHT"}, "e4_peek": {"ep": 4, "title_en": "Through the gap", "title_zh": "门缝", "next": "e4_found", "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/a74169b70a67409c9f526c200c1ff035/e4_peek.mp4"}, "idle": null, "captions": [{"s": 9.42, "e": 10.81, "who": "EDMUND", "en": "Where did you put it, Aunt Margaret?", "zh": "你到底把它放哪儿了，玛格丽特姑妈？"}], "look": "NIGHT"}, "e4_found": {"ep": 4, "title_en": "What he was looking for", "title_zh": "他在找的东西", "next": null, "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/6ffd6fe7253a4ab3aab65fa04ae20bb6/e4_found.mp4"}, "idle": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/ee5d511a0c544c8ba39aa5431882eb2e/e4_found.mp4", "captions": [{"s": 15.14, "e": 16.81, "who": "IVY", "en": "Is this what he was looking for?", "zh": "他要找的……就是这个？"}], "look": "NIGHT", "qte": {"kind": "tap", "icon": "✉️", "en": "Open it", "zh": "拆开", "prompt_en": "A letter from Madam", "prompt_zh": "夫人留下的信", "hint_en": "Tap to break the seal", "hint_zh": "点击拆开封蜡", "goto": "e4_letter", "timeout": "e4_letter", "seconds": null, "danger": false, "ok": {}, "lead": 0.3}}, "e4_letter": {"ep": 4, "title_en": "Madam's letter", "title_zh": "夫人的信", "next": "ep5", "media": {"none": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/1d586d155fc94e1fb3d0c5a047e8806e/e4_letter.mp4"}, "idle": null, "captions": [{"s": 3.44, "e": 8.15, "who": "IVY", "en": "If you're reading this, he chose you. Don't let them rush him.", "zh": "如果你在读这封信，说明他选了你。别让他们逼他。"}], "look": "NIGHT", "summary": {"note_en": "Madam left one more letter. Edmund was looking for it, and Earl Grey found it first.", "note_zh": "夫人还留下了一封信。埃德蒙在找它，而伯爵先一步找到了。"}}, "ep5": {"ep": 5, "title_en": "Episode 5", "title_zh": "第 5 集", "next": null, "media": {}, "idle": null, "captions": [], "look": null, "end": true, "kicker_en": "Coming soon", "kicker_zh": "敬请期待", "note_en": "Edmund knows the letter exists. Your choices so far will follow you there.", "note_zh": "埃德蒙知道这封信的存在。你做过的每个选择，都会跟着你走下去。"}}, "lite": {"https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/82ea2f7527d94714aa035759f37c9e68/e4_corridor.mp4": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/a99f87e7fc5c4b62b06324b2d903fed5/e4_corridor.mp4", "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/6ffd6fe7253a4ab3aab65fa04ae20bb6/e4_found.mp4": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/f4a855e40219444b8063ae2ede07019a/e4_found.mp4", "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/c04a03008071487fa6f7368c42453945/e3_A.mp4": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/5ec20ac92bc349cc8c803ad32686b519/e3_A.mp4", "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aicap/uploads/usr_4a6e5fb234d64da0a9429e519b299f07/ef6ed75a75554e95906a2c1de108741a/e4b_night0.mp4": "https://storage.googleapis.com/waku-core-aic